<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A1326029" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "03" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
MAF Sensor with IAT Sensor-1 Inspection
</title>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1326029001">
<title>
MAF Sensor
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove MAF sensor with IAT sensor-1. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1326028"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check sensor O-ring (2) for damage and deterioration. If faulty condition is found, replace MAF sensor with IAT sensor-1.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Arrange 3 new 1.5 V batteries (3) in series, and check that total voltage is 4.5 to 5.0 V.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Connect MAF sensor with IAT sensor-1 (1) to batteries and oscilloscope (4) as shown in figure.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check signal waveform changes depending on amount of blowing air [a] as shown in figures.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If faulty condition is found, replace MAF sensor with IAT sensor-1. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1326028"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFRA0B132022.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "62.889mm" ver = "01" gw = "221" gh = "162"/>
</figure>
<figure>
<title>
Blowing air [a]: Small
</title>
<graphic graphicname = "IFRA0B132023.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "51.127mm" ver = "01" gw = "158" gh = "128"/>
</figure>
<figure>
<title>
Blowing air [a]: Large
</title>
<graphic graphicname = "IFRA0B132024.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "51.127mm" ver = "01" gw = "158" gh = "128"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1326029002">
<title>
IAT Sensor-1
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove MAF sensor with IAT sensor-1. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1326028"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check sensor O-ring (2) for damage and deterioration. If faulty condition is found, replace MAF sensor with IAT sensor-1 (1).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check that resistance between sensor terminals varies depending on temperature while blowing hot air to temperature sensing part (4) of MAF sensor with IAT sensor-1 using hot air drier (3).
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If faulty condition is found, replace MAF sensor with IAT sensor-1. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1326028"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFKA0P130034.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "52.816mm" ver = "01" gw = "223" gh = "133"/>
</figure>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IBK80P130011.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "62.221mm" ver = "01" gw = "175" gh = "160"/>
